{"name":"Sunlounge","hex":"#da8433","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[],"entries":[{"title":"Sunroom","blocks":[{"text":"A sunroom, also frequently called a solarium, is a room that permits abundant daylight and views of the landscape while sheltering from adverse weather. Sunroom and solarium have the same denotation: solarium is Latin for \"place of sun[light]\". Solaria of various forms have been erected throughout European history. Currently, the sunroom or solarium is popular in Europe, Canada, the United States, Australia, and New Zealand. Sunrooms may feature passive solar building design to heat and illuminate them."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f1/Hatoyama_Hall_%28sun-room%29.jpg/330px-Hatoyama_Hall_%28sun-room%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sunroom"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/dd/Wintergarten_%28Eingefahrener_Sonnenschutz%29_%28Anemometer%29.jpg/500px-Wintergarten_%28Eingefahrener_Sonnenschutz%29_%28Anemometer%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/dd/Wintergarten_%28Eingefahrener_Sonnenschutz%29_%28Anemometer%29.jpg/1280px-Wintergarten_%28Eingefahrener_Sonnenschutz%29_%28Anemometer%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/dd/Wintergarten_%28Eingefahrener_Sonnenschutz%29_%28Anemometer%29.jpg/500px-Wintergarten_%28Eingefahrener_Sonnenschutz%29_%28Anemometer%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A German \"Wintergarten\" with open blinds and anemometer (top left)","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AWintergarten_(Eingefahrener_Sonnenschutz)_(Anemometer).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f5/Jamnagar_Solarium_-_Indian_Review_1936_-_37-3.jpg/500px-Jamnagar_Solarium_-_Indian_Review_1936_-_37-3.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f5/Jamnagar_Solarium_-_Indian_Review_1936_-_37-3.jpg/500px-Jamnagar_Solarium_-_Indian_Review_1936_-_37-3.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Revolving solarium in Jamnagar, India designed by Jean Saidman","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AJamnagar_Solarium_-_Indian_Review_1936_-_37-3.jpg"}],"sounds":{}}}